the choice of provider and of the three `verified` models: judge/llm/openai_client.py, judge/llm/run.py,
and `verified_models()` in run.py). Not on gears-matcher's main yet; the commit above is unchanged.

Also carried over by hand from gears-matcher branch feat/openai-client: the LiteLLM provider
(judge/llm/litellm_client.py, a subclass of the OpenAI-compatible client with its own LITELLM_*
